  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p><iframe id=\"v424fG2Gee2htot2PohFLLh\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v424fG2Gee2htot2PohFLLh?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY0MjRmRzJHZWUyaHRvdDJQb2hGTExoIiwidGlkIjoiMTQxNTgyZjUtMzIyMC00NDkzLTg0ZDctNjk1YmM0NzFlZjY0IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg0MzEzfQ.YFc_l3bXORlopCOylqmhd0F4_JCzvPIuJUgJB5UW30xW_y8-Sf6Ohvj8D0kE7cfDkZ7bFha5cDKJgLBfCWXBkQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
